      "h1": "Wheel of Feelings and Emotions Round Rug, Educational Men - Design 107",
      "live_title": "Wheel of Feelings and Emotions Round Rug, Educational Men - Design 107",
      "live_body_text": "<p>This round rug features a vibrant \"Wheel of Feelings and Emotions\" design, making it an engaging and educational tool. It is specially crafted to help users identify, understand, and express emotions, fostering better communication skills. Ideal for various learning environments, this rug brings a comforting and interactive element to any space.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Colorful feelings wheel design for emotional learning.</li>\n<li>Educational animal and shape elements enhance engagement.</li>\n<li>Offers a soft and comfortable surface.</li>\n<li>Made from durable, odor-resistant, and wear-resistant polyester.</li>\n<li>Suitable for a wide range of indoor settings and activities.</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain with regular vacuuming or washing.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Round</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Classroom, Bedroom, Playroom, Homeschool, Office, Library, Learning Center</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Odor Resistant, Wear Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Animal, Flower, Crayon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Back to School, Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Educational</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum regularly. Hand wash in cold water or machine wash separately. Air dry or tumble dry on low heat. Avoid bleach.</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This educational rug is perfect for creating a calm and welcoming atmosphere in classrooms, counseling spaces, homeschool areas, and playrooms. It also works well in bedrooms, offices, and libraries, offering a comfortable spot for learning, group activities, or quiet time.</p>",
