      "h1": "Wheel of Feelings Round Rug for Counseling Office Classroom and Home",
      "live_title": "Wheel of Feelings Round Rug for Counseling Office Classroom and Home",
      "live_body_text": "<p>The Wheel of Feelings and Emotions Round Rug is a thoughtfully designed educational and calming tool, ideal for helping children and adults alike explore and communicate their feelings. This visual mood chart serves as an interactive resource for mental health awareness, making it an excellent addition to educational environments, counseling offices, or cozy home spaces. Constructed to support emotional literacy, its colorful layout brings both personality and meaningful utility to any setting.</p>\n\n<h3>Product Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Features an engaging feelings wheel and emotional awareness design to support mental health and self-expression.</li>\n<li>Crafted with high-quality polyester and soft memory foam for a comfortable and plush surface.</li>\n<li>Includes a practical non-slip backing to keep the rug securely in place.</li>\n<li>Odorless, wear-resistant, durable, and designed with fade-resistant colors safe for families and pets.</li>\n<li>Versatile and easy to clean, making it suitable for active kids, classrooms, and daily use.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form Type</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Round</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Classroom, living room, bedroom, kid's room, entrance, laundry, kitchen, hallway, office, dormitory</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance Level</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Non Slip, Stain Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>ABC Alphabet, Cute Rainbow, Grayson, Pencil, My Feelings</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Back to school gifts, teacher rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style Name</td>\n<td>Boho, ABC, Rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3>Material &amp; Care</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Back Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Recommended to hand wash in cold water or machine wash separately; do not use bleach. Tumble dry or air dry at low temperature. Avoid prolonged soaking and high temperature exposure. Regular vacuuming is recommended.</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3>Where It Works</h3>\n<p>This educational emotions carpet is perfectly suited for school classrooms, counseling offices, and homeschool environments. It also functions beautifully as an interactive play rug in children's bedrooms, nurseries, and family living rooms.</p>",
